CE FND-118 consistency rail: the SAME current-source dipole as
CE dipole-ex4-gn2-near-ground-51seg.nec, but 2 lambda up (42.2 m at 14.2 MHz)
CE instead of 0.024 lambda. Far from the ground the drive must converge on its
CE own free-space answer.
CE The old bespoke current-source solver's disagreement with the voltage drive
CE decayed monotonically with height -- 6.5% at 0.024 lambda, 3.8%, 1.8%, 0.64%
CE at 0.5 lambda, 0.24% at 1 lambda, 0.09% at 2 lambda -- which is the signature
CE that placed the defect in the ground coupling rather than in the drive.
